==English==

===Interjection===
{{en-interj|head=[[man]] [[overboard]]!}}

# {{lb|en|nautical}} {{n-g|A cry used to announce that one of the [[crew]] or [[passenger]]s has fallen over the side of the vessel.}}

====Usage notes====
The cry is always ''man overboard'', regardless of the gender of the person involved.

